---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Interactive Fiction — Adam Dolin" description="Twine games and other interactive narratives by Adam Dolin.">

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <a href="/work" class="back-link">&larr; Back to Work</a>

      <div class="section-header">
        <span class="label">Writing Samples</span>
        <h1>Interactive</h1>
        <p class="page-intro">Interactive narratives in multiple formats.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="mini-fiction card">
        <div data-passage="start">
          <p class="passage-prompt">What would you like to play?</p>
          <div class="choice-list">
            <button class="choice" data-goto="quests">YouTube videos of quests I wrote</button>
            <a class="choice" href="/work/goblin-atelier">A Twine game I wrote for my class</a>
            <button class="choice" data-goto="netflix">Stranger Things: Face the Dark</button>
            <button class="choice" data-goto="values">A values quiz I designed</button>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div data-passage="quests" class="is-hidden">
          <p class="nda-note">Due to NDAs, I can't share actual scripts from the games I've worked on publicly — but here are links to playthroughs of some of the quests I wrote. Click each one for the story behind it.</p>
          <div class="fiction-entry">
            <button class="entry-toggle" aria-expanded="false">
              <strong>God of War (2018)</strong> — The Anatomy of&nbsp;Hope&nbsp;<span class="entry-chevron" aria-hidden="true">&#9656;</span>
            </button>
            <div class="entry-context">
              <p>My favorite script I wrote for a God of War (2018) side quest. Kratos and Atreus' dialog during these boat conversations was directly influenced by my own experience of losing my father to cancer during the game's development in 2016. This quest holds a special place in my heart.</p>
              <a href="https://youtu.be/YENEb4YEVxg?si=Fb9ArZAqiPj6Ptlq&t=63" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="entry-cta">Watch a playthrough &rarr;</a>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="fiction-entry">
            <button class="entry-toggle" aria-expanded="false">
              <strong>God of War Ragnar&ouml;k</strong> — The Song of the&nbsp;Sands&nbsp;<span class="entry-chevron" aria-hidden="true">&#9656;</span>
            </button>
            <div class="entry-context">
              <p>I'm particularly proud of this quest chain. With two potential companions (Atreus or Freya) across two different areas, this quest remains one of the most difficult I've ever written, both in terms of its logical complexity and ensuring that each version was equally compelling. The final script for this mission ended up around 70 pages.</p>
              <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=W32Y-kBS3uo" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="entry-cta">Watch a playthrough &rarr;</a>
            </div>
          </div>
          <a href="https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLw8qrSr2ZYiSDdfOhBMdmaUqhIAnlzzEk" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="playlist-link">Playlist of all other God of War side quests</a>
          <button class="choice choice-back" data-goto="start">&larr; Choose again</button>
        </div>

        <div data-passage="netflix" class="is-hidden">
          <div class="fiction-entry">
            <button class="entry-toggle" aria-expanded="false">
              <strong>Stranger Things: Face the&nbsp;Dark</strong>&nbsp;<span class="entry-chevron" aria-hidden="true">&#9656;</span>
            </button>
            <div class="entry-context">
              <p>I consulted on narrative and game design for this escape room at Netflix House in Dallas.</p>
            </div>
            <a href="https://www.netflix.com/house/experiences/stranger-things" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="entry-cta">Learn more <svg class="ext-icon" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"/><polyline points="15 3 21 3 21 9"/><line x1="10" y1="14" x2="21" y2="3"/></svg><span class="sr-only">(opens in a new tab)</span></a>
          </div>
          <button class="choice choice-back" data-goto="start">&larr; Choose again</button>
        </div>

        <div data-passage="values" class="is-hidden">
          <div class="fiction-entry">
            <button class="entry-toggle" aria-expanded="false">
              <strong>WhatAreMyCoreValues.org</strong>&nbsp;<span class="entry-chevron" aria-hidden="true">&#9656;</span>
            </button>
            <div class="entry-context">
              <p>An interactive values exploration tool — a quiz that helps you discover and rank your core values.</p>
            </div>
            <a href="https://whataremycorevalues.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="entry-cta">Take the quiz &rarr;</a>
          </div>
          <button class="choice choice-back" data-goto="start">&larr; Choose again</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</BaseLayout>

<script>
  document.querySelectorAll('.entry-toggle').forEach((toggle) => {
    toggle.addEventListener('click', () => {
      const open = toggle.parentElement.classList.toggle('is-open');
      toggle.setAttribute('aria-expanded', String(open));
    });
  });

  document.querySelectorAll('.choice').forEach((btn) => {
    btn.addEventListener('click', () => {
      const target = btn.dataset.goto;
      if (!target) return; // link-style choices navigate instead
      document.querySelectorAll('[data-passage]').forEach((p) => {
        p.classList.toggle('is-hidden', p.dataset.passage !== target);
      });
    });

    // Feed the cursor's horizontal position to CSS as --mx (0–100%)
    // so the sunset gradient and glow can follow the mouse
    btn.addEventListener('mousemove', (e) => {
      const rect = btn.getBoundingClientRect();
      const x = ((e.clientX - rect.left) / rect.width) * 100;
      btn.style.setProperty('--mx', `${x}%`);
    });
  });
</script>

<style>
  .back-link {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    text-decoration: none;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xl);
    transition: color var(--transition-fast);
  }

  .back-link:hover {
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  .page-intro {
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    max-width: 640px;
  }

  .mini-fiction {
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    margin-top: var(--space-2xl);
    max-width: 720px;
  }

  /* A low sun cresting the top-right corner: its center sits on the
     corner itself, so only a quarter of the disc is ever visible.
     Hidden until the card is hovered, then it rises in. */
  .mini-fiction::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: -240px;
    right: -240px;
    width: 480px;
    height: 480px;
    background: radial-gradient(
      circle closest-side,
      rgba(240, 208, 160, 0.85),
      rgba(232, 184, 152, 0.5) 12%,
      rgba(232, 160, 112, 0.3) 30%,
      rgba(216, 136, 120, 0.15) 52%,
      rgba(127, 181, 201, 0.06) 70%,
      transparent 78%
    );
    opacity: 0;
    transition: opacity 500ms ease;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .mini-fiction:hover::before {
    opacity: 1;
  }

  .is-hidden {
    display: none;
  }

  .passage-prompt {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);
  }

  .choice-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: var(--space-sm);
  }

  .choice {
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    display: inline-block;
    text-decoration: none;
    font: inherit;
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    background: none;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-accent);
    border-radius: 6px;
    padding: var(--space-sm) var(--space-md);
    cursor: pointer;
    text-align: left;
    transition: color var(--transition-fast), transform var(--transition-fast), border-color var(--transition-fast);
  }

  /* Sunset band along the top border — slides with the cursor (--mx),
     so blues rise on the left and corals on the right */
  .choice::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    height: 2px;
    background: linear-gradient(
      90deg,
      var(--color-blue),
      var(--color-sage),
      var(--color-gold),
      var(--color-accent),
      var(--color-coral),
      var(--color-peach)
    );
    background-size: 300% 100%;
    background-position: var(--mx, 50%) 0;
    opacity: 0;
    transition: opacity var(--transition-fast);
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  /* Soft warm glow pooled under the cursor, like light off a cold brew */
  .choice::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    border-radius: inherit;
    background: radial-gradient(
      140px 70px at var(--mx, 50%) 0%,
      rgba(232, 160, 112, 0.28),
      rgba(216, 136, 120, 0.12) 45%,
      transparent 75%
    );
    opacity: 0;
    transition: opacity var(--transition-base);
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .choice:hover {
    color: var(--color-accent-hover);
    border-color: var(--color-accent-hover);
    transform: translateY(-1px);
  }

  .choice:hover::before,
  .choice:hover::after {
    opacity: 1;
  }

  .choice-back {
    margin-top: var(--space-xl);
    border-color: var(--color-text-muted);
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }

  .choice-back:hover {
    border-color: var(--color-accent);
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  .nda-note {
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);
  }

  .fiction-entry {
    padding: var(--space-md) 0;
  }

  .entry-toggle {
    font: inherit;
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 2px;
    background: none;
    border: none;
    padding: 0;
    text-align: left;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .entry-chevron {
    display: inline-block;
    transition: transform var(--transition-base);
  }

  .fiction-entry.is-open .entry-chevron {
    transform: rotate(90deg);
  }

  .entry-toggle:hover {
    opacity: 0.8;
  }

  /* Context is collapsed by default and revealed by clicking the title */
  .entry-context {
    max-height: 0;
    opacity: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
    transition: max-height var(--transition-base), opacity var(--transition-base);
  }

  .fiction-entry.is-open .entry-context {
    max-height: 400px;
    opacity: 1;
  }

  .entry-context p {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-top: var(--space-sm);
  }

  .entry-context a {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    margin-top: var(--space-sm);
  }

  .playlist-link {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    margin-top: var(--space-md);
    transition: color var(--transition-fast), transform var(--transition-fast);
  }

  .playlist-link:hover {
    color: var(--color-accent-hover);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
    transform: translateX(3px);
  }

  .entry-cta {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    text-decoration: none;
    margin-top: var(--space-sm);
    transition: color var(--transition-fast), transform var(--transition-fast);
  }

  .entry-cta:hover,
  .entry-context .entry-cta:hover {
    color: var(--color-accent-hover);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
    transform: translateX(3px);
  }

  /* Watch links inside the expanded story match the entry title size */
  .entry-context .entry-cta {
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
  }

  .ext-icon {
    width: 0.85em;
    height: 0.85em;
    vertical-align: -0.08em;
    margin-left: 0.2em;
  }

  .sr-only {
    position: absolute;
    width: 1px;
    height: 1px;
    padding: 0;
    margin: -1px;
    overflow: hidden;
    clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0);
    white-space: nowrap;
    border: 0;
  }
</style>
